  "title": "Explicit native measured capture-retirement startup",
  "$comment": "Exact v15 owners plus separately authorized measuredCaptureRetirement. Setup remains the single browser/helper issuance purpose. Capture retirement cannot borrow staged-pending or refresh-family permission, infer an authenticated subject, silently broaden a token-only request or reopen a retired provider scope. These cold data do not create grants, currentness barriers, native owners, signed receipts or provider success.",
